 "summary": "The family product, the Hom-section and inhomogeneous-term products, and the chart converse for inhomogeneous terms have no counterpart in Mathlib or Tau Ceti, and they build on existing tooling (`contMDiff_hom_bundle_prod_iff`, `contMDiff_hom_bundle_iff`, `Bundle.Pullback.contMDiff_iff`/`contMDiff_lift`, `equivTangentBundleProd`). The closest existing code is `ContMDiffAlmostComplexStructure.prodFamily` and `ContMDiffAlmostComplexStructureFamily.ofChart`; the first needs a fixed first block and the second covers a single bundle, so neither can replace these declarations.",
